WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:04.600
But the path you must 
take lies beyond that.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:08.270
A fragment of BB's soul remains inside you.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:10.720
I'm going to use this machine

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:13.460
to show you BB's memories.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:16.010
It is the past,

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:18.700
as well as your future.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.090
The Past

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:57.220
Can we trust him?

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.720
The gift of top secret US data that 
he brought us appears to be real.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.720
Though we will need to keep 
an eye on his movements...

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:20.200
I don't think it's a bad idea 
to add him to Brahman.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:24.330
You did well to come so far against Cal.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.910
I'm Ajita, captain of Brahman.

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.710
Blood Blackstone. Call me BB.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.710
Well then, BB, we'll talk again soon.

00:02:41.050 --> 00:02:42.220
Nice to meet you.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:44.220
I'm Varma, from Brahman.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.470
That was awesome back there!

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.230
The princess is sure to hire you.

00:02:49.560 --> 00:02:51.940
Princess? Not the king?

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:54.400
Uh... Yeah, well...

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:57.490
The princess is a very wise lady,

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.950
so the king relies on her a great deal.

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:02.950
You've passed the test.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:05.490
You can call yourself a member 
of Brahman as of today.

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:09.790
I also have the results of your match test.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.460
You can use the triggerless tattoo.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:12.960
Really, now?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.170
Never thought I'd have a shot at that.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:18.010
They don't even have the technology 
to test it in America.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.920
I've read the data you brought.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.470
The reason tattoo research 
isn't progressing in America

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.430
is most likely because the inscription 
in the ruins was lost.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:28.930
This is an invaluable tattoo.

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.940
If you betray me,

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:33.810
I will take it back in 
exchange for your death.

00:03:44.660 --> 00:03:47.700
<i>America doesn't have the 
technology to destroy tattoos.</i>

00:03:48.540 --> 00:03:51.120
<i>If it exists anywhere, it's here.</i>

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:03.470
This is a changing room?

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.930
What do you want?

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.560
This building seemed out of 
place, so I was curious.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.190
This is Japanese architecture, isn't it?

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.190
Come to think of it, 
you're Japanese, too, aren't you?

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.650
Just one quarter.

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.070
The princess built this place for me.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:23.570
It's my practice hall.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:26.870
The princess, eh?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.040
I will give you one warning.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:35.290
You are welcome to walk around 
the castle as you like,

00:04:35.960 --> 00:04:37.670
but if you value your life,

00:04:37.670 --> 00:04:40.210
don't go near Samsara.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:46.140
<i>Now, how to get in there undetected?</i>

00:04:46.430 --> 00:04:49.010
Hmm, how to get in there undetected?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.440
What are you doing here?

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.610
The princess is doing something weird!

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.190
I'm trying to find out what she's after!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.190
I see.

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:05.200
You're a spy the king sent to 
keep an eye on the princess.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.030
I've even heard you're the king's lover.

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.910
Well, you're a spy for the 
US Army, aren't you?!

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.450
The US Army has nothing to do with me.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:14.330
So, that building...

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.830
Is that the center of 
their tattoo research?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.500
That's right, but...

00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:22.340
So the princess took it over? 
What's security like?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:24.800
There are no guards. There's only...

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:28.590
The guardian of Samsara!

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.890
The mysterious, superhuman 
being who's blind and deaf...

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.390
Ganesha!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:37.900
Run!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.150
You'll slow me down!

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:41.520
Don't you dare die!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.960
Damn it. This one's going to be trouble.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:10.600
This must be the restorative 
power I've heard about.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:15.350
So, Your Majesty, I believe 
we can trust him.

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.480
BB is an amazing man!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:22.270
With him, I'm sure we can 
expose the princess's schemes.

00:06:23.860 --> 00:06:24.900
Very well.

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.490
Work with him.

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:30.780
If he does anything suspect, 
dispose of him yourself.

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:32.530
Yes, sir!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.990
Let's do our best together, BB!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:37.910
Just so you know, I don't swing that way.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:40.790
One question.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.710
That princess isn't your 
real daughter, is she?

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.500
I see.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.840
Your intelligence-gathering 
ability is impressive, indeed.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.550
You are correct. She is not my child.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:54.260
But what of it?

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:57.520
What of it, you ask? You're unbelievable.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:00.270
She's going to take your throne.

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.940
If you're not blood-related, 
it's even more likely.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.610
Yet you're not even trying 
to stop her scheming.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:10.450
It's because you feel some kind 
of guilt toward her, isn't it?

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.700
You...

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.450
I guess even Varma didn't tell you that.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:16.410
Don't push your luck, you child!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.000
This conversation is over! Leave!

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:22.120
What is that old bigot's problem?

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.420
Now, now...

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.290
BB, time for your first mission.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.960
I heard some interesting information.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:31.180
I want you and Cal to 
guard the first ruins.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.220
If an enemy shows up,

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:35.890
eliminate them.

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:38.890
Telling me to trample my former life, eh?

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:47.690
Finish him.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.110
These guys are American soldiers.

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:51.530
We can just take them prisoner.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:55.530
You seem to have a powerful 
aversion to killing.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:56.740
Why is that?

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:01.500
Your sense of camaraderie 
as a former US soldier?

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.420
It's my policy.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.710
Whether a man is a sinner or a saint,

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:09.170
he has the right to advocate 
for his own idea of justice.

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:12.760
Denying another human's idea of 
justice is my definition of evil.

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.430
That's why I won't kill.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:18.890
Well, unfortunately,

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:21.480
the princess's orders were 
to eliminate any enemies.

00:08:24.730 --> 00:08:26.270
Now it's all taken care of.

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.400
Let's head back.

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.920
This is Iltutmish. 
She was assigned to Brahman today.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.550
Princess, I can't read this.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.010
What? You can't read?

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:59.180
Is it a good idea to bring 
in a girl like that?

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:02.480
If I should one day succeed the throne,

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.230
I am considering transferring much of

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.730
the king's authority to the parliament.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:09.940
What do you say?

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:26.290
I see...

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:30.460
You're fighting for someone 
you care about, too.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.920
You really are strong.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:36.300
My courage always fails me 
when it really counts.

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:39.260
I'm... a weak person.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.550
I wouldn't say that.

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:47.270
If you can master this, 
someone like that is nothing.

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.480
It's been a year and a 
half since you arrived.

00:09:50.820 --> 00:09:53.900
I'm sure it won't be long before 
the princess makes a move.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.900
We're going to infiltrate Samsara tonight.

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.490
Understand we'll only have one chance.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.660
We have to swipe some damning evidence

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:03.740
and get that old man to act.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.120
I don't want to upset the king...

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:12.290
But I'm not confident that 
I'm really doing the right thing.

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:15.670
The king is keeping his 
true feelings hidden,

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.180
but since I've been near him 
all this time, I can tell.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:22.300
His feelings toward the 
princess are obligation

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.180
and love.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.940
I thought you were just scared of Ganesha.

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.770
So that's what worries you.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:32.940
You're not weak at all.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.900
As long as you live, you have a future.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:40.110
There's no telling whether it'll 
be rose-colored or mud-colored,

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.780
but if you have no future, 
your path leads nowhere.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:47.410
You're always looking to the future.

00:10:48.410 --> 00:10:49.420
That's what makes you strong.

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:59.880
This is enough to knock most 
opponents unconscious.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:19.360
So this is your trigger, huh?

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:21.610
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:28.410
Varma!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:31.870
Watch me, Your Majesty!

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:45.850
Without your tattoo, 
you're just a naughty little brat.

00:11:57.230 --> 00:11:59.030
If we dig a tunnel directly below here,

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.570
it should take us to 
Samsara's deepest level.

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.240
<i>What is this?</i>

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.790
<i>Did I overuse my power?</i>

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.200
What's wrong?

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:11.330
Nothing. Let's go.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:18.630
I will kill them all.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.170
Gosh, you're so good!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.590
No way! You can make that into a combo?

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:23.800
Il-san, you're ruthless!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:34.060
My, my. Visitors?

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:37.940
We won't eat you or anything. 
You can come in.

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:42.780
What's this place? Who are you?

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:43.900
It's our playroom.

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.280
Nice to meet you. I'm Kujuli,

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:48.910
Arya's older sister.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.200
Her older—

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.660
So you're a princess, too?!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:53.910
No, that's just Arya.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.920
Those two are Fima and Kashinika.

00:12:57.840 --> 00:12:58.920
Haven't seen you before.

00:12:59.210 --> 00:13:00.630
They're visitors.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:03.130
Most likely spies for the king.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:06.890
Hey, BB, it looks like she's 
already figured us out.

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.720
You don't have to worry.

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:10.680
We're playing a game.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.020
I'll show you around.

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:17.020
The researchers are stationed 
upstairs, though,

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.060
so I can't show you that.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.570
Is this really Samsara?

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:23.990
It's the residential quarters 
in the deepest level.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.820
This is where we live...

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.910
and where we were made.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:35.120
And it's our entire world.

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.970
You're all clones of Arya?

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.590
That Ganesha girl outside, too?

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.800
We do look like her, but we're not clones.

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:52.060
We're more like sisters.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.060
I'll explain everything from the beginning.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:58.190
It's been about 35 years since the ruins

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:00.690
in the Kingdom were discovered.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:04.490
After he realized the potential of tattoos,

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:08.820
the king tried to use the ruins 
to rewrite the world as he desired.

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:13.200
That was when the Kingdom was trying to 
expand its territory through military force.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.160
But the problem was that

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.920
the interface for controlling the ruins

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.040
was in a place where no one could reach it.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.130
The tattoos' dimension?

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:27.510
Yes. That's why we sisters were created.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:31.300
The most complete of them all was Arya.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.310
She's an input device in 
the shape of a human.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.230
All the sisters living here are failures.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:41.400
We can only live here in Samsara.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:43.900
Why are you telling us all this?

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:46.240
We're enemies of the princess.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:50.450
I don't hate humans as much as Arya does...

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:51.910
I suppose.

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:56.370
So you're saying you want us to stop Arya?

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:59.790
Let's just say that a part 
of me does feel that way.

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.540
You're not making yourself clear.

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:04.090
We sisters' souls are partially fused,

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:06.880
with Arya at the center.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:10.970
While I am Kujuli, I am a part of Arya.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.850
I wouldn't say that's the reason,

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:16.520
but there are some who, 
unlike me, are in favor or Arya.

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:23.730
Secret Technique 
Carp Climbing the Waterfall!!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.240
Chel! Fizul!

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:31.780
You're not allowed to do as you please 
in here without my permission!

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.780
What is this? It's just a gun controller!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.700
If you keep goofing around like this,

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.750
I'll tell Kashinika that 
you erased her save!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.960
But those guys are Arya-nee's enemies!

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:47.170
Stylish...

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.300
Honestly...

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.930
Il and the maids were with her.

00:15:54.340 --> 00:15:56.390
Why do I have to go check on her?

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:57.390
<i>Hi, this is Kujuli.</i>

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.640
Forgive me for calling so late.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:01.850
<i>Has anything happened there?</i>

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:05.560
Nothing out of the ordinary.

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:09.530
Cal! There's a pervert in sunglasses 
and an obvious pervert here!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.740
They're screwing everything! Help!

00:16:11.990 --> 00:16:13.240
I'm not a pervert!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.660
You should get away from here, quickly!

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:22.870
We should be able to manage with
what we were able to download.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:24.540
We should hurry! 
The guards will be here soon!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.840
Don't forget.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:31.550
My hope is also one of 
the options in Arya's heart.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:32.380
Yeah.

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:36.140
I'll make sure your hope survives.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:41.480
Run as fast as you can! 
Straight to the old man!

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.560
Varma!

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:50.400
Their presence is moving farther away.

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:54.030
They escaped?! How could you 
permit such a failure?!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:57.160
Hey! Circle the castle immediately!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.450
So that damn BB really made his move.

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:01.410
I never thought he'd defeat Ash...

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.000
I'm sor—

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.250
I don't need apologies!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:07.790
Listen to me. Now that I control 
most of the parliament and military,

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:10.170
there's no way my father will hide BB!

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:14.170
Don't let BB take one step 
outside this country!

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:15.180
Yes, ma'am!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:21.270
Until Arya gained control of this place,

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:24.430
we weren't even treated as humans.

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:30.070
I wasn't the only one to be abused.

00:17:30.690 --> 00:17:34.110
But we sisters have endured 
it by supporting each other.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:36.820
I love all of them.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:39.620
That's why I won't endorse Arya.

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:44.370
To deny humans would mean denying ourselves.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.750
Deny humans?

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:48.790
Doesn't the princess

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:53.380
just want revenge on the king for causing 
all the abuse you've been through?

00:17:53.840 --> 00:17:56.130
Revenge is just part of the process!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:00.430
Arya-nee wants to use the power of tattoos to

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:02.350
rebuild the whole world, including humans!

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.430
Why would she go that far?

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:08.850
What do you think that old bastard 
did in order to create us sisters?!

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:19.200
Are you happy now?

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:21.160
All of this...

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.660
All of it was brought on by you yourself!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:27.410
The descendants of the tattoos' 
creators were in the Kingdom.

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:31.040
They didn't even know about the tattoos, 
but they were closer to them than anyone.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:32.460
You don't mean...

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:35.170
Yes! Human experiments!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.720
And on a huge scale!

00:18:37.130 --> 00:18:40.090
They had their bellies and heads split 
open while they were still alive,

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.390
and were driven mad within 
experimental rigs!

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.890
Sperm samples were taken from the men,

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:47.430
and young women were forcefully impregnated

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:49.310
and forced to bear many children!

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:52.860
Just to create the tool called Arya,

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.110
the king wiped out an entire clan!

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.610
Three thousand people! Every last one!

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.990
When Arya-nee found out,

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:02.410
she couldn't bear the thought that

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:05.370
she was of the same species 
as such a demon.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:15.920
Varma...

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:24.600
Sorry... BB...

00:19:34.860 --> 00:19:38.400
I was prepared to accept Arya's hatred.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.910
But if she was going to turn her 
attacks upon this country itself,

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.830
I felt that I needed to do something.

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.960
But I had no idea the reality 
was something so trivial.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.500
So do you really plan to die?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.500
My mistake wasn't in seeing Arya as a tool,

00:19:55.790 --> 00:19:58.380
but rather in loving her as a daughter.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.380
As a result,

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:03.760
I gave her both the power and 
the reason to overthrow me.

00:20:05.850 --> 00:20:08.770
Varma fought to keep you alive.

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:11.730
Are you going to ignore his wishes?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:15.360
It's already too late.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.690
It's not too late!

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.610
I won't let you die! I swear it!

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:23.570
And what can you do on your own?

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.130
Come with me.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.550
Even Arya doesn't know about this railway.

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.430
Flee this country.

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:52.560
If you found your way to the 
heart of this country alone,

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:56.310
and even exposed Arya's secret, 
I'm sure you can manage this.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:57.770
I wasn't alone.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.070
I pulled it off because Varma was with me.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.490
Of course.

00:21:05.320 --> 00:21:06.450
Please...

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.830
give him praise for me.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:17.250
Now, go, failed hero of justice.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:19.460
And save this nation...

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.170
and its people.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:34.890
To tell the truth,

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:37.900
I was the one who brought up the idea of

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.440
exposing the princess's scheme to the king.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.820
I convinced him that, 
since I was his lover,

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:46.610
she wouldn't be able to do 
anything to me so easily.

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:49.570
Of course, I was scared,

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:53.120
but hopes can't be realized 
if you don't take action.

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:15.850
But the reality is that not many weak 
people can realize their hopes.

00:22:16.520 --> 00:22:18.730
There are many things in this 
world that can't be helped,

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:20.190
no matter how you struggle.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.650
As a result, the weak remain weak forever.

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:28.740
That's why we need people we 
can entrust our hopes to.

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:58.060
All I managed to do was keep 
the king's hope alive.

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:02.190
But I was able to pass it along to 
someone who can make it a reality.

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:04.900
That gave my life meaning.

00:23:05.940 --> 00:23:08.950
BB, you're my hero.

00:23:13.870 --> 00:23:16.620
I wasn't your hero at all.

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:24.960
<i>But I won't let that hope be cut short.</i>

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:44.150
I've had you grow stronger 
over this past year

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:46.900
so that you would survive 
to the final moment.

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:51.200
What makes you think you 
can win as you are now?

00:23:51.780 --> 00:23:54.990
Letter of Challenge

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:54.910
She is the strongest Sealed of all.
